<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">19062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>The Strait of Hormuz has reopened, and Brent crude has slipped to seventy-nine dollars on a fresh memorandum between Washington and Tehran.</s> <s>But the diplomacy runs weeks ahead of the oil itself... roughly five hundred tankers sit trapped behind mined waters and barnacle-fouled systems that must be cleared before a single barrel moves.</s> <s>For importers in India, Pakistan, and China, the announcement and the supply are not yet the same thing.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Near the Bangladesh border in West Bengal, Muslims and Rohingya families have begun shrinking from public view after sweeping gains by India's <sub alias="B J P">BJP</sub>.</s> <s>Electoral majoritarianism has quietly converted citizenship paperwork into a weapon, where lacking the right document now risks detention as a so-called infiltrator.</s> <s>Stateless residents face an escalating choice between invisibility and expulsion, and Western wires are barely carrying it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United States and Venezuela jointly struck and killed the founder of Tren de Aragua on <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">12062026</say-as>, and that precedent is already drifting.</s> <s>Analysts now ask whether Colombia's National Liberation Army — some six thousand three hundred fighters sheltered by Chavista elements — becomes the next target, a disciplined political insurgency rather than a prison gang.</s> <s>Colombia's fragile peace process may be what pays the price.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A British court has jailed two men, one a serving immigration officer, for spying on Hong Kong democracy exiles on behalf of Beijing.</s> <s>Chi Leung Wai mined the United Kingdom's own immigration database to track dissidents, the first China-spy convictions on British soil.</s> <s>Exile, it turns out, is no longer safe distance when authoritarian states can recruit inside a host country's border force.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's Special Seats Bill would reserve thirty-seven constituencies for women-only contests, a direct answer to a stark imbalance.</s> <s>Women are half the population yet hold just four and a half percent of the National Assembly, near the bottom of African and global rankings.</s> <s>Passage demands a constitutional amendment and a two-thirds majority, so the binding constraint is design, not voter will.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pentagon chief Pete Hegseth has berated European allies as shameful for refusing to back the American strikes on Iran.</s> <s>After France and Italy denied United States jets basing for the mission, he ordered a six-month review of American forces in Europe, turning troop posture into punishment.</s> <s>Poland, which backed the operation, is now scrambling for a permanent base, and Europe's strategic-autonomy debate just accelerated.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Mexico's review of its trade pact with the United States and Canada has become, in effect, a China policy test.</s> <s>Washington wants proof that Mexico is not a back door for Chinese goods, yet Mexican factories depend on Asian inputs to build the very exports that cross the border duty-free.</s> <s>It's where the rivalry between two superpowers gets enforced on someone else's factory floor.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Egypt is moving to end a fourteen-year ban on genetically modified seeds, with the state-linked Future of Egypt Authority coordinating with the German giant Bayer.</s> <s>The deal would grant privileges modelled on Monsanto's global framework, pending a parliamentary vote expected within months.</s> <s>Once cultivation depends on patented seed, the dependency becomes structural, and food sovereignty is hard to win back.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's two hundred and forty million phone users have gained their first authorized Apple channel.</s> <s>The local distributor GNext now offers official warranty and zero-percent instalment plans through Daraz, in a market long ruled by grey-market imports.</s> <s>Apple still hasn't confirmed whether a physical store in the country will follow.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Democratic Republic of the Congo's Ebola outbreak has now killed two hundred and two people since mid-May.</s> <s>The Africa <sub alias="C D C">CDC</sub> confirms eight hundred and seventy-five cases, with the virus crossing into Uganda, where nineteen infections and two deaths have appeared.</s> <s>Ituri province holds ninety-five percent of cases in a conflict-worn east where surveillance gaps let it spread unseen.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A satellite-tagged humpback off Oman has just broken a long-held assumption about its own kind.</s> <s>This population of roughly eighty whales is believed to be the only humpbacks on Earth that never migrate, yet one made an unexpected long-distance journey.</s> <s>In a group this small, every individual rewrites the map that conservation planning in Gulf waters depends on.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>On Lake Victoria, Kenyan fish farmers are now receiving artificial-intelligence alerts before disaster strikes.</s> <s>A single overnight oxygen crash can erase an entire season's income, but cheap sensor-and-model systems buy farmers hours to aerate or move their stock.</s> <s>This is the Global South deploying the technology on its own terms, though scaling it still waits on connectivity the lake's regions lack.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Volcanic pumice has buried Papua New Guinea's coastline under meters of floating rock.</s> <s>The Titan Ridge eruption has severed subsistence communities from fishing and transport, smothering the waters they live by.</s> <s>Pumice rafts can persist for months and drift across whole oceans, and no one has offered a timeline for clearing it.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The United Arab Emirates has given platforms twelve months to verify user ages and disable every account held by someone under fifteen.</s> <s>Self-declaration won't be accepted, and artificial-intelligence-backed verification is now mandatory.</s> <s>It's the first Arab state to require it, following Australia and several European governments down the same path.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bulgaria licensed the export of powerful spyware to governments with records of abuse, according to Human Rights Watch.</s> <s>From twenty-eighteen to twenty-twenty-three, Sofia approved sales of the Circles interception system to agencies in rights-abusing states.</s> <s>Whether those approvals breached European Union export rules is the question Bulgaria has yet to answer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Microsoft has flagged a self-propagating worm that spreads through ordinary <sub alias="U S B">USB</sub> drives.</s> <s>It watches the clipboard for cryptocurrency-address patterns, silently swaps in an attacker's address mid-transaction, then smuggles seed phrases out over the Tor network.</s> <s>The lesson for any crypto user is uncomfortable — air-gapped is not safe, and the clipboard is an attack surface few people watch.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>